## 6. Create `jobs` table and check that `max_salary` does not exceed 25000

```sql
CREATE TABLE jobs (
    job_id INT,
    job_title VARCHAR(35),
    min_salary DECIMAL(6,0),
    max_salary DECIMAL(6,0),
    CHECK (max_salary <= 25000)
);
